description: "recorded 2026-09-16, session record-log-20260916T002036Z S001, a 61 s hold on the de-torqued head. Lower and askew on purpose; one eye is bigger. The fold leans inboard past straight down so gravity loads the gearbox play to one side; six motion-probe runs at the earlier symmetric -3.32/3.32 fold, 8 degrees outboard of this one, read 0-1 counts of excursion (probe-log-20260909T014542Z and five after; the first is fixtures/traces/trace-antenna-fold-still.csv). The antennas are where that hold left them."
